    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620060/extras/aba2bee0ada78c62fd40661ab3543085.avif?t=1752842603\" width=600 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A family curse. A deadly heirloom. A race against time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of Hidden Legacy: Dark Heirloom \u2014 a Hidden Object Puzzle Adventure game. This is a story-rich, point-and-click adventure where you'll explore beautifully crafted scenes, search for cleverly hidden objects, and solve a variety of challenging puzzles. It's a perfect mix of mystery, logic, and visual exploration \u2014 ideal for players who enjoy immersive storytelling and clever gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tale follows renowned genealogist Gabriel Vanyard, who is drawn into the chilling mystery of the Montgomery family. Their legacy is tied to a cursed ring that brings death to its bearer. From the moss-covered ruins of an Irish estate to the majestic Scottish Highlands and bustling streets of London, Gabriel must uncover the truth and break the curse before it claims the last heir. What secrets lie within the Montgomery bloodline \u2014 and can they be unraveled in time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a thrilling range of gameplay experiences: search for hidden objects across eerie and enchanting scenes, challenge your logic with creative mini-games, and test your focus with brain-teasing puzzles. Each scene offers a fresh opportunity to prove your detective skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Collector's Edition includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Hidden Object scenes across multiple hauntingly atmospheric locations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Travel through gripping environments: crumbling estates, shadowy ruins, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Discover and collect dozens of hidden items and special collectibles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Dozens of tricky puzzles and relaxing mini-games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Unlock achievements that reveal deeper layers of the story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Dive into the immersive soundtrack, stunning wallpapers, and rich atmosphere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shadows of the past \u2014 the hidden legacy awaits. Uncover a deadly family secret in this haunting adventure!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620060/extras/aba2bee0ada78c62fd40661ab3543085.avif?t=1752842603\" width=600 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A family curse. A deadly heirloom. A race against time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of Hidden Legacy: Dark Heirloom \u2014 a Hidden Object Puzzle Adventure game. This is a story-rich, point-and-click adventure where you'll explore beautifully crafted scenes, search for cleverly hidden objects, and solve a variety of challenging puzzles. It's a perfect mix of mystery, logic, and visual exploration \u2014 ideal for players who enjoy immersive storytelling and clever gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tale follows renowned genealogist Gabriel Vanyard, who is drawn into the chilling mystery of the Montgomery family. Their legacy is tied to a cursed ring that brings death to its bearer. From the moss-covered ruins of an Irish estate to the majestic Scottish Highlands and bustling streets of London, Gabriel must uncover the truth and break the curse before it claims the last heir. What secrets lie within the Montgomery bloodline \u2014 and can they be unraveled in time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a thrilling range of gameplay experiences: search for hidden objects across eerie and enchanting scenes, challenge your logic with creative mini-games, and test your focus with brain-teasing puzzles. Each scene offers a fresh opportunity to prove your detective skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Collector's Edition includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Hidden Object scenes across multiple hauntingly atmospheric locations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Travel through gripping environments: crumbling estates, shadowy ruins, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Discover and collect dozens of hidden items and special collectibles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Dozens of tricky puzzles and relaxing mini-games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Unlock achievements that reveal deeper layers of the story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Dive into the immersive soundtrack, stunning wallpapers, and rich atmosphere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shadows of the past \u2014 the hidden legacy awaits. Uncover a deadly family secret in this haunting adventure!</p>",
